				39 00 00 40 00 00 05 2A 00 00 04 37
				39 00 00 40 00 00 05 2B 00 00 09 43

				39 00 00 40 00 00 03 90 03 83
				39 00 00 40 00 00 13 91 AB 28 00 04 F2 00 02 52 00 4B 00 07 28 00 19 6D 10 F0
				15 00 00 40 00 00 02 6F 12
				39 00 00 40 00 00 13 91 02 02 22 00 2A 40 2A BE 3A FC 3A FA 3A F8 3B 38 3B 78
				15 00 00 40 00 00 02 6F 24
				39 00 00 40 00 00 0D 91 3B B6 4B B6 4B F4 4B F4 6C 34 84 74

				15 00 00 40 00 00 02 53 20
				39 00 00 40 00 00 11 3B 00 1C 00 30 00 1C 03 60 00 1C 09 C0 00 1C 00 30
				15 00 00 40 00 00 02 6F 10
				39 00 00 40 00 00 05 3B 00 1C 00 30
				39 00 00 40 00 00 06 F0 55 AA 52 08 00
				15 00 00 40 00 00 02 6F 02
				39 00 00 40 00 00 03 B5 24 C6
				15 00 00 40 00 00 02 6F 23
				39 00 00 40 00 00 03 B5 24 06
				39 00 00 40 00 00 06 F0 55 AA 52 08 04
				15 00 00 40 00 00 02 6F 02
				15 00 00 40 00 00 02 B5 0C

